OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order submits new 'limited'
OL,4,ADrumcree parade plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith, of the Garvaghy
OL,7,FRoad Residents' Coalition, has
OL,8,Fcriticised the plan and said there was
OL,9,F"no compromise".
OL,11,FPortadown District Master Nigel Dawson
OL,12,Fcalled for mediation and dialogue but
OL,13,Fadded "we will take our fight to the
OL,14,Fcourts" if necessary.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
